1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,760
We just have to follow the floating stones

25
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:14,480
to the entry of the first trial.

26
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,600
Old ghost Duanmu,

27
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,840
are we inside the Ancient God's body ?

28
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,400
This is just an entrance,

29
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:27,000
a passage leading to the Ancient God's body.

30
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,320
It may be

31
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:31,240
just a single hair of the Ancient God.

32
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:35,080
Stop with your nonsense.

33
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:38,000
If this is just a single hair,

34
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,160
wouldn't the Ancient God's body

35
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:42,200
be larger than planet Suzaku ?

36
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,600
An adult Ancient God's body

37
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:47,440
is many times larger than planet Suzaku.

38
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,520
Then how long will it take to cross it ?

39
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,520
Where is the Ancient God's bag of holding ?

40
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:57,120
Ancient Gods didn't use bags of holding.

41
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,840
They kept their artifacts

42
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,880
hidden within their own bodies.

43
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,120
New guy,

44
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,920
since it's your first time in the Land of the Ancient God,

45
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,440
don't be too greedy.

46
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,320
Don't put on airs,

47
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:14,040
aren't we all here for the Soul Transformation Pills ?

48
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,480
You're not wrong,

49
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,520
our goal this time

50
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:19,960
is indeed the Soul Transformation Pills.

51
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,240
The rumors say that after completing all the trials,

52
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:25,400
they can be found within the Ancient God's meridians.

53
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
However...

54
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:31,400
we aren't here just for the Soul Transformation Pills.

55
00:03:32,640 --> 00:03:33,240
Oh ?

56
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,200
What do you mean by that ?

57
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,360
There are countless treasures here.

58
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,680
Even though the Ancient God is dead,

59
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,240
his Divine Sense remains.

60
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:45,800
It's just in a dormant state.

61
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:48,640
If one can enter its body

62
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,640
and obtain its memories

63
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:51,720
then

64
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,520
any spell stored in its memory

65
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,880
would be incredibly powerful

66
00:03:57,640 --> 00:04:00,320
in the present day and age.

67
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,200
These Soul Formation Devil Lords

68
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:07,600
came here before but failed to pass the trials

69
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:10,480
and spent a 1000 years preparing for this trip.

70
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,840
It shows how dangerous this place is...

71
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:16,600
I must find a way to escape quickly...

72
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,960
What are these stars ?

73
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,680
Why is my Ji Realm so restless ?

74
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:25,680
Kid,

75
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,440
don't overthink it.

76
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,960
Try not to provoke it,

77
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:33,320
it's been asleep for thousands of years.

78
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,120
It's just a beast,

79
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,120
it's not worth mentioning.

80
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,360
This is bad !

81
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,640
Des... A Desolate Beast...

82
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:09,640
What do we do ?

83
00:05:09,640 --> 00:05:10,440
Flee !

84
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,000
Core Formation brat,

85
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,280
die in my place !

86
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:51,680
Fear !

87
00:05:52,320 --> 00:05:53,560
Six Desires brat,

88
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,560
what are you doing !?

89
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,400
This Desolate Beast is too fast,

90
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,360
so you will delay it for me.

91
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,040
How dare you !?

92
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,920
An Early stage Soul Formation

93
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,920
should be glad to die in my stead.

94
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,640
The entrance to the first trial is right ahead,

95
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,960
Everyone,

96
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,400
don't hold back now !

97
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,320
Fear !

98
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,640
Whether the Eight Extremes Devil Lord wins or loses,

99
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,320
I have no way out...

100
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:59,280
Note: 1 zhang = 1m

101
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,680
A Flood Dragon over a 1000 zhang long

102
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,800
possesses various innate abilities

103
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,280
and is astonishingly powerful.

104
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:02,640
If it's a Desolate Beast over 10 000 zhang long,

105
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,840
its innate abilities will be even more powerful.

106
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,680
Even legendary Soul Formation cultivators can't resist it.

107
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,200
Middle stage Soul Formation

108
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,320
against a Peak Late stage Soul Formation Desolate Beast

109
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,560
should have no chance at all.

110
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,720
But why isn't the Desolate Beast using spells ?

111
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:20,960
Is something wrong here ?

112
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,720
So that's why !

113
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,080
Let's go !

114
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,120
As expected of Master !

115
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,320
With a single glance

116
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,440
you saw that this dragon's belly was the safest place !

117
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,320
Once the Devil Lords are gone,

118
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:21,840
we can get out !

119
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,800
I was right, something was wrong.

120
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,520
The outside is just a dead body

121
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:10,280
and the true dragon was inside.

122
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:22,000
So it's not a true Desolate Beast

123
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,200
but a parasite in a Desolate Beast's corpse.

124
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,080
Since that's the case,

125
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,480
I can kill it !

126
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:16,720
Wan'er told me

127
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:19,360
the true treasure of a Flood Dragon is not its core

128
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,760
but its marrow.

129
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:54,920
It's gone...

130
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,640
I shouldn't stay here.

131
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,400
This is...

132
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,320
Why is it completely ineffective ?

133
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,600
There's a beast in the void

134
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,680
that's intelligent.

135
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:35,000
And there is more than one...

136
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,760
It seems I can't bypass them.

137
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,040
15 days later

138
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:00,680
Crossing a few hundred zhang

139
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,800
took me 15 days.

140
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,520
I'm out of artifacts.

141
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,800
If I stay here any longer,

142
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:12,720
it will lead to my death.

143
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:16,120
A spatial rift opens and closes in half a breath.

144
00:14:16,560 --> 00:14:19,400
I can fly to the teleportation formation in less than half a breath,

145
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,280
then this is the last step

146
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,440
and my last chance.

147
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:46,800
It's her...

148
00:14:46,800 --> 00:14:47,600
Senior...

149
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,240
This is for you.

150
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:51,560
Senior,

151
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:54,080
The cultivation path is extremely dangerous

152
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:56,840
but I hope that if you encounter danger in the future,

153
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,640
this formation can delay it for a moment.

154
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,200
If it helps you,

155
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,600
Wan'er will be satisfied.

156
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,120
Thank you.

157
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,720
If this passage is so dangerous

158
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,880
then the trials must be unimaginably difficult.

159
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:09,320
If I take a wrong step

160
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:11,200
with my current cultivation,

161
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,000
I will die for sure.

162
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,520
I need to leave this place at once.

163
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,440
This shape is...

164
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,960
top-quality spirit stones ?

165
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:39,880
As expected,

166
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:42,070
my regular spirit stones are useless.

167
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:44,000
But Duanmu Ji came here last time

168
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:45,720
and was able to leave halfway.

169
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:48,160
That means he has another way out.

170
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,360
Let's not overthink this.

171
00:16:57,560 --> 00:16:58,640
In that case,

172
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,480
I just need to pass the trials !

173
00:17:06,990 --> 00:19:29,570
Think of "Spirit Beasts" and "Desolate Beasts" as cultivation levels for beasts.

174
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:42,920
Count the specks of time

175
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:42,920
floating down gently.

176
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:49,160
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

177
00:17:50,280 --> 00:17:56,680
Forever lock away the scars

178
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:56,680
of this mortal life.

179
00:17:56,940 --> 00:18:03,200
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

180
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:10,920
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

181
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:10,920
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

182
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:18,080
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

183
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:18,080
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

184
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:20,600
I will ask the heavens who exactly

185
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:25,360
sliced open this world

186
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:25,360
to let the rain fall in.

187
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:27,360
I will refine the world

188
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,880
to make our palm lines say

189
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,240
that we will live forever.

190
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:35,160
Walking off the beaten path

191
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:38,240
through heaven and earth.

192
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:45,200
Before returning to dust,

193
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:45,200
I will refine this mortal body.

194
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:54,080
The left shore is the joyous laughter

195
00:18:50,600 --> 00:18:54,080
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

196
00:18:54,080 --> 00:19:00,680
The right shore is an eternal silence

197
00:18:55,680 --> 00:19:00,680
lingering under the candlelight.

198
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,560
To overturn this fate,

199
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:07,920
I will walk against the heavens.

200
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:15,080
I will even gather the clouds

201
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:15,080
to illuminate the sky for you.

202
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:19,320
All this sadness was not meaningless.

203
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:22,640
How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?

204
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:28,440
I vow to break

205
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:28,440
this chess game of fate.

206
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:39,400
I vow to break

207
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:39,400
this chess game of fate.
